tom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-0d29cfe6-91b0-0135-ca40-79bbfda7fec5\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">consequence, and if it was already moderate, it becomes severe.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-0d29cfe6-91b0-0135-ca40-79bbfda7fec5\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: 700; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Defend the Weak.</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> When someone is attacked physically while within your zone, you can spend a fate point to redirect that attack to yourself. You may defend against that attack at +1. (Fate System Toolkit, p.41)</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-0d29cfe6-91b0-0135-ca40-79bbfda7fec5\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: 700; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Powers</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-0d29cfe6-91b0-0135-ca40-79bbfda7fec5\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: italic; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Legacy Powers</span></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-0d29cfe6-91b0-0135-ca40-79bbfda7fec5\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Legacy can fly with Athletics. </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This functions just like running or