imes New Roman'; font-weight: 700; font-style: italic; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Overwhelmed By Distress Calls</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-0d29cfe6-91b0-0135-ca40-79bbfda7fec5\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-style: italic; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Collateral Damage Effect: </span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Flying Smash: It&rsquo;s pretty trivial for you to just pick someone up </span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">and toss &lsquo;em through the scenery. You can take out a nameless NPC entirely, or deal a mild consequence to anyone else, at the expense of the structural integrity of the buildings around you.</span></p><p><br />&nbsp;</p>",
